{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brickstrike is an online multiplayer first-person shooter where every block can be destroyed or rebuilt. Shape the battlefield, outsmart your rivals, and fight for victory in a variety of action-packed competitive game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the Battlefield Your Way.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/58f89fd3406ac21d22b49bf92f0e6312.poster.avif?t=1767673899\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/58f89fd3406ac21d22b49bf92f0e6312.webm?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/58f89fd3406ac21d22b49bf92f0e6312.mp4?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No two matches are ever the same. Build towering defenses to control the high ground. Fortify chokepoints to stall the enemy advance. Or grab your trusty shovel and dig a labyrinth of tunnels beneath enemy lines to gain the edge. Every voxel you place or destroy can change the tide of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lock n' Load.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/fd81cefa0a4ba4a596935a1cdf8d2da3.poster.avif?t=1767673899\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/fd81cefa0a4ba4a596935a1cdf8d2da3.webm?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory demands versatility. Customize your loadout with an arsenal of weapons and tactical equipment designed to match any mission profile. Whether that\u2019s rushing the frontlines or sneaking deep inside enemy territory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fought Together. Built Together.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/e53ffa627884a91f545ebb9a7a82d0d7.poster.avif?t=1767673899\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/e53ffa627884a91f545ebb9a7a82d0d7.webm?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/e53ffa627884a91f545ebb9a7a82d0d7.mp4?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own battlegrounds with powerful editing tools or import existing voxel maps from other software. Upload to the official repository, share with the community, and see your creations played worldwide. Want full control? Host your own server and be listed directly in the official client.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Us. To You.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brickstrike is being developed by Caleb Helbling, a former developer of the open source pyspades server for Ace of Spades (pre-Jagex). His work includes iconic game modes like <i>Tower of Babel</i> and <i>Arena</i>. Brickstrike is an evolution of that legacy - rebuilt for the modern era.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758260?t=1767673899","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/54c3e72ca075c43a0ff71888bfa8b010d6de0ba0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767673899","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/b86aba2408d53bb6e58f73348299454f235134e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767673899","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/b86aba2408d53bb6e58f73348299454f235134e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767673899","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brickstrike is an online multiplayer first-person shooter where every block can be destroyed or rebuilt. Shape the battlefield, outsmart your rivals, and fight for victory in a variety of action-packed competitive game modes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape the Battlefield Your Way.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/58f89fd3406ac21d22b49bf92f0e6312.poster.avif?t=1767673899\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/58f89fd3406ac21d22b49bf92f0e6312.webm?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/58f89fd3406ac21d22b49bf92f0e6312.mp4?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > No two matches are ever the same. Build towering defenses to control the high ground. Fortify chokepoints to stall the enemy advance. Or grab your trusty shovel and dig a labyrinth of tunnels beneath enemy lines to gain the edge. Every voxel you place or destroy can change the tide of battle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lock n' Load.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/fd81cefa0a4ba4a596935a1cdf8d2da3.poster.avif?t=1767673899\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/fd81cefa0a4ba4a596935a1cdf8d2da3.webm?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory demands versatility. Customize your loadout with an arsenal of weapons and tactical equipment designed to match any mission profile. Whether that\u2019s rushing the frontlines or sneaking deep inside enemy territory. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fought Together. Built Together.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/e53ffa627884a91f545ebb9a7a82d0d7.poster.avif?t=1767673899\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/e53ffa627884a91f545ebb9a7a82d0d7.webm?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/extras/e53ffa627884a91f545ebb9a7a82d0d7.mp4?t=1767673899\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your own battlegrounds with powerful editing tools or import existing voxel maps from other software. Upload to the official repository, share with the community, and see your creations played worldwide. Want full control? Host your own server and be listed directly in the official client.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From Us. To You.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brickstrike is being developed by Caleb Helbling, a former developer of the open source pyspades server for Ace of Spades (pre-Jagex). His work includes iconic game modes like <i>Tower of Babel</i> and <i>Arena</i>. Brickstrike is an evolution of that legacy - rebuilt for the modern era.</p>","developers":["Extensional Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758260/0ceb76e13d9a3a9760db9e0c96e8577cbcc8395b/header.jpg?t=1767673899","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3758260/572659963/c0743af471aadb4087be1dad62e6bd8964978bd6/1753552160/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762957501","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3758260/572659963/c0743af471aadb4087be1dad62e6bd8964978bd6/1753552160/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762957501","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3758260/572659963/c0743af471aadb4087be1dad62e6bd8964978bd6/1753552160/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762957501","id":257174335,"name":"Brickstrike Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257174335/159159879d44546c5cdafec392a5cd228826dad5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762957501"}],"name":"Brickstrike","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-1035G7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel Iris Plus Graphics<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Extensional Software"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia fantasiosa","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"b